{"version":1,"key":"card:688","content":{"id":688,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"59bbff4b-c9c8-4805-a3fc-2cf3f80159ea","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 HTTP/1.0 的时代，每次发送请求都需要发起 TCP/IP 连接，服务器在处理完这次响应之后，就会断开 TCP/IP 连接，这会导致性能问题："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"3d152a67-ad1b-4463-a89d-a572df8df9ff","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e59d0fc0-1f9d-4740-920c-e7e5efa191e1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5087b182-4cb5-4934-8050-72e9d463bf30","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每次请求都要进行 TCP/IP 三次握手和四次挥手，这个过程会耗费大量时间以及占用网络资源"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"18fad3ea-4c61-4c12-bee5-6050c02b22c2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6e636787-1092-4504-aef1-7a3ae0a7dcca","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"TCP 刚建立连接时，为了避免拥塞，会慢慢的发送包来试探网络带宽，即使网络情况良好，每次请求也还是需要经历慢启动的过程"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"831b0faf-d8c4-432a-bfbc-4e04155a6755","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e40fb8b6-2211-4411-b168-b68dbc305816","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"频繁地建立和销毁连接，会导致服务器上产生大量的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"TIME_WAIT"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 状态的端口，消耗服务器的 CPU 和内存"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d97a6be6-3fab-4338-b4fa-284ded7d70f1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了解决这个问题，在 HTTP/1.1 中提出了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Connection: keep-alive"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的请求头，来保持 HTTP 的持久连接，只要一端没有明确的要求断开，那么 TCP 连接就会始终保持连接状态，后续的 HTTP 请求可以复用同一个 TCP/IP 连接。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"18197dbc-73d9-4924-a070-b1d5dba7b9b5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是复用同一个 TCP/IP 连接会带来一个新的问题，即多个响应之间的消息边界在哪里？在不使用持久连接的时候，每个请求一个连接，连接断开就表示响应结束，但是在持久连接中，TCP 始终保持连接，在处理响应时怎么知道当前请求的响应结束了，会不会读到下一个请求的响应？为了解决这个问题，HTTP 引入了 "},{"type":"content-link","contentId":1581,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","refId":591,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"c4ddacf3-d235-4b25-b241-51fd18d10a2a","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Content-Length"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"content-link","contentId":1582,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","refId":592,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"3927446c-522a-41d9-8bb3-1b80908c543c","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Transfer-Encoding"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 两个响头来指示消息边界的位置。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d1e8ada1-bf2a-4f90-8f1e-20af5d1c98e9","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Content-Length"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就是用来指定响应体的大小的，比如 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Content-Length: 1024"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就表示响应体有 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1024"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 字节大小，当客户端处理完响头头之后，在读取 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1024"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个字节，就是响应体的内容，后续的内容就是下一个请求的响应。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7b257554-3ea8-4076-93d1-e779a06a1ed3","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Content-Length"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 适合已知大小的响应体，比如图片，HTML 文件等，对于动态的响应内容，比如耗时较长的数据库查询，或者大文件流，如果使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Content-Length"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来作为消息边界，为了得到数据的大小，就需要先把内容加载到内存中，会带来较大的延迟和内存消耗。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"da3ab3ba-2477-4f08-a909-2a149805e620","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Transfer-Encoding"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 适合这种动态大小或者需要流式返回结果的场景，服务器在响应头中添加 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Transfer-Encoding: chunked"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 响应头，表示我会把数据切成一块一块的发给你，每一块数据在发送前，都会先发送这一块的十六进制长度，然后加上回车换行（"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"\\r\\n"},{"type":"formatted","text":"），接着是数据本身，再加回车换行。在最后，会发送一个空块来表示数据传输完成，这个响应就结束了。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTTP","uuid":"8548f5ae-c02c-4aaa-88b2-cbbaecaf4515","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"a13707f0-f6f2-44c0-85b0-0bf39ab53b9a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"HTTP/1.1 200 OK\nContent-Type: text/plain\nTransfer-Encoding: chunked\n\n7\\r\\n          <-- 第一块的长度是 7 个字节 (十六进制)\nMozilla\\r\\n    <-- 第一块的数据\n9\\r\\n          <-- 第二块的长度是 9 个字节\nDeveloper\\r\\n  <-- 第二块的数据\n0\\r\\n          <-- 长度为 0，代表响应结束！\n\\r\\n","collabId":"86592db5-448b-4775-bd45-b5900463ae5b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["HTTP/长连接","HTTP/Content-Length","HTTP/Transfer-Encoding","概念对比"],"createTime":1774259396833,"updateTime":1775053572846,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1775053572846},"links":{"card:591":{"key":"card:591","type":"card","id":591},"card:592":{"key":"card:592","type":"card","id":592}}}